get.description:
Returns tenant-visible durable generation state. A completed resource
includes the immutable output Beleg and exact processor/ruleset evidence;
failures expose no internal diagnostic or storage identity.

ZUGFeRDPDF.description:
Durable ZUGFeRD PDF state. Pending has neither result nor failure;
completed has the new immutable output Beleg and exact generation evidence;
failed exposes only a stable public failure code.
